# Cross-platform checkout policy for byte-sensitive repository artifacts.
#
# Generated TypeScript sources are compared byte-for-byte against LF-joined
# generator output. Keep them LF on every platform regardless of core.autocrlf.
*.generated.ts text eol=lf

# VBO snapshots are bound to SHA-256 / Git-blob provenance evidence and must
# retain their exact committed bytes. Never apply text or line-ending filters.
data/vbo/** -text
